# .htaccess — Austek Engineering (Hostinger, Apache/LiteSpeed)
#
# One job: never serve the internal files that come along when this folder is
# uploaded as-is. On 16 September 2026 README.md, .gitignore and .gitattributes
# were all downloadable from the live site. The README says the headline figures
# are unconfirmed and the enquiry form is not connected — not a good read for a
# prospect.
#
# RedirectMatch 404 answers with a plain "not found" rather than a "forbidden",
# which would confirm the file is there. The same rules run on the Position Xero
# and Cognexa sites on this host.
#
# /.well-known/ stays reachable — SSL certificate renewal uses it.
RedirectMatch 404 /\.(?!well-known(/|$))
RedirectMatch 404 \.(md|log|bak|sql|sh|ya?ml|lock)$
RedirectMatch 404 ^/package(-lock)?\.json$
